Name:P17c - staying home loses to a team pump the opponent has shown (round 1036)
Description:Three Silvercoat Lions (2/2) attack. The AI, at 12 life, has two Serra Angels (4/4) untapped. The opponent has four Plains untapped, two cards in hand, and Inspired Charge (instant, creatures you control get +2/+1) in the graveyard. Each Angel is worth more than a Lion and dies to a Lion at +2/+2, so with TRICK_ALLOWANCE_ON_BLOCK neither is a "safe" block. Round 1035's danger term added the trick once (6 on the board + 2 leaves 4: not in danger), so the AI kept both Angels home, and a second Inspired Charge deals 12. Round 1036 counts a shown team pump on every unblocked attacker (6 + 3 x 2 leaves 0: in danger), so the Angels block. Expect: a Lion dies and the AI lives. Stock Forge passes (the Angels are safe blocks on the board).
